3:T109e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Scrivens offer home eye tests?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Scrivens provides a comprehensive home visit service for patients who are unable to travel to a branch due to illness, disability, or mobility issues. A qualified Scrivens optometrist will visit your home with portable testing equipment and a selection of frames, so you can have your eyes tested and order glasses without leaving the house. If you qualify for an NHS-funded eye test, the home visit is also free. This is one of Scrivens' most valued services, particularly for elderly patients."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Scrivens a family business?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Scrivens was founded in 1938 by Douglas Scrivens and remains family-run to this day. The founding family continues to be actively involved in the management of the business. This family ownership is reflected in the culture of the company, which prioritises personal relationships with patients and a community-focused approach to eye care and hearing care."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Scrivens do hearing tests?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, hearing care is a core part of the Scrivens service. Every Scrivens branch offers hearing assessments, which are provided free of charge by qualified audiologists. If hearing loss is detected, Scrivens can supply both NHS-funded hearing aids (where eligible) and private digital hearing aids from leading manufacturers. The combination of optical and hearing care under one roof is a significant convenience for patients."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where are Scrivens branches located?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Scrivens operates approximately 100 branches across the Midlands, the South West, and the South of England. Concentrations include the West Midlands (Birmingham, Coventry, Wolverhampton), the East Midlands (Nottingham, Leicester, Derby), the South West (Bristol, Bath, Exeter, Plymouth), and parts of southern England (Southampton, Portsmouth, Reading, Oxford). They do not currently have branches in the North of England, Scotland, Wales, or Northern Ireland."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much do glasses cost at Scrivens?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Scrivens offers a range of frames at competitive prices. Complete glasses — frames with single-vision lenses — start from around £49. The selection includes a mix of own-brand frames and recognised mid-range brands. Lens upgrades such as anti-reflection coatings, varifocals, and thinner lenses are available at additional cost. NHS optical vouchers are accepted and can be put towards the cost of glasses for eligible patients."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I get an NHS eye test at Scrivens?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Scrivens provides free NHS-funded eye tests for all eligible patients. Eligibility is the same as at any UK optician — children under 16, adults over 60, those on qualifying benefits, and patients with certain medical conditions. Scrivens also provides NHS-funded home visits for eligible patients who cannot attend a branch in person."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Scrivens offer hearing aids on the NHS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Scrivens is contracted to provide NHS hearing aids at many of its branches. If you are referred by your GP or if a Scrivens audiologist identifies hearing loss, you may be eligible for a free NHS digital hearing aid. Private hearing aids are also available for patients who want a wider choice of styles and technology levels, with prices starting from around £395 per aid."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book a home visit with Scrivens?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can arrange a Scrivens home visit by searching for your nearest branch on eyetest.co.uk and selecting the home visit option when booking, or by contacting your local Scrivens branch directly. You will need to confirm that you or the person requiring the test is unable to attend the branch unaccompanied. Home visits are available for both eye tests and hearing assessments."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Scrivens Opticians & Hearing Care\",\"url\":\"https://www.scrivens.com\",\"description\":\"Scrivens is a well-established family-run opticians and hearing care group with around 100 branches across the Midlands, South West, and South of England. Founded in 1938, they combine the reach of a national chain with the personal touch of a family business. Scrivens is particularly well regarded for their hearing care services alongside traditional optical care, and they have been a trusted name in communities across their regions for decades.\",\"foundingDate\":\"1938\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"numberOfEmployees\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"name\":\"UK stores\",\"value\":100},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.scrivens.com\"],\"parentOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Opticians\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Scrivens Opticians & Hearing Care\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians/scrivens\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7",false,"$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}],"$L10"],["$L11"],"$L12"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ssq08EaNRRySny1_GDRUp"}
