urement, and a thorough examination of the internal and external health of the eyes. Scrivens is known for providing unhurried, personal attention even within the NHS test framework."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Free (if eligible)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"20-25 minutes"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4 text-center","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-success)]/10","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-4 h-4 text-[var(--color-success)]","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}]}]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Private Eye Test"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"A comprehensive eye examination for patients who do not qualify for NHS-funded testing. The test covers refraction, binocular vision assessment, eye pressure, and eye health examination. Scrivens' private test is competitively priced and provides the same thorough clinical assessment as the NHS test."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £25"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"25-30 minutes"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4 text